sequenceDiagram
    participant Writer
    participant SharedMemory
    participant Reader

    note over Writer, Reader: System V Shared Memory

    Writer->>SharedMemory: ftok("shmfile", 65) - Generate key
    Writer->>SharedMemory: shmget(key, 1024, 0666 | IPC_CREAT) - Create shared memory segment
    Writer->>SharedMemory: shmat(shmid, NULL, 0) - Attach to shared memory
    Writer->>SharedMemory: strcpy(str, "Hi from writer process!") - Write data
    Writer->>SharedMemory: shmdt(str) - Detach from shared memory

    Reader->>SharedMemory: ftok("shmfile", 65) - Generate key
    Reader->>SharedMemory: shmget(key, 1024, 0666) - Get shared memory segment
    Reader->>SharedMemory: shmat(shmid, NULL, 0) - Attach to shared memory
    Reader->>SharedMemory: Read data
    Reader->>SharedMemory: shmdt(str) - Detach from shared memory
    Reader->>SharedMemory: shmctl(shmid, IPC_RMID, NULL) - Remove shared memory segment
    
    note over Reader, SharedMemory: Reader removes the shared memory segment
